    "chunk_text": "mid urum Drihtne, we & he \u00e6teowde us swa he sl\u00e6pende w\u00e6re to costianne, ond dyde swi\u00fee hreonesse \u00f0\u00e6re s\u00e6we, fram We us \u00fea swi\u00fee ondredon & cegdon to him Drihtne H\u00e6lendum Criste, & he \u00fea aras & bebead \u00fe\u00e6m Nu \u00feonne, min bearn, ne ondr\u00e6da\u00fe ge eow, for\u00feon \u00fee ure God us ne forl\u00e6te\u00fe. Ond \u00feus cwe\u00feende se halga Andreas asette his heafod ofer \u00e6nne his discipula & he onslep. Drihten H\u00e6lende Crist \u00fea wiste, for\u00f0on \u00fee se halga Andreas \u00fea slep. He cw\u00e6\u00fe to his englum, Genima\u00fe Andreas & his discipuli & asetta\u00f0 hie beforan Mermedonia ceastre; \u00dea englas \u00fea dydon swa him beboden w\u00e6s; & he astag on heofenas. \u00d0a se morgen geworden w\u00e6s beforan Mermedonia ceastre, & his discipulos \u00f0\u00e6r sl\u00e6pende w\u00e6ron mid Witon we \u00fe\u00e6t ure Drihten mid us w\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m scipe, & we hine ne ongeaton; he hine geea\u00f0medde Se halga Andreas \u00fea locodeon heofenas & he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Min Drihten H\u00e6lend Crist, ic wat \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu ne eart Nu \u00feonne, Drihten, ic \u00fee bidde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu me \u00fee \u00e6teowe on \u00feisse stowe. \u00dea \u00f0is gecweden w\u00e6s, Drihten him \u00e6teowde his onsyne on f\u00e6geres cildes heowe, & him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Se halga Andreas \u00fea hine geb\u00e6d & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Forgif me, Drihten \u00fe\u00e6t ic to \u00f0e sprecende w\u00e6s swa to men; Drihten him \u00fe",
